what is this script?
what does it do?

deploys the proper requirement to help this app to work out of the box.

the script makes a directory named ~/logs/

to help app to know where to logs so the user can trouble shoot if anything fails. 
*drive-download.log 
*drive-backup.log
*drive-upload.log

_______________________________________________

also it will help the .py and .sh extension to have enabled excute is true in the ui's directory.



also the app will be better supported out of the box if the Proton-Drive Cli bianry file is in /usr/bin/




